06:41.000 --> 06:48.000
where we are going to transfer H i prime using H inverse here onto the image of xi.

06:48.000 --> 06:54.000
And then we are going to compute this distance here and use it as the error measure as well.

06:54.000 --> 07:01.000
And this is known as the symmetric transfer of the error because we are doing it in both directions.

07:01.000 --> 07:05.000
Hence, we can see that there are two terms here.

07:05.000 --> 07:13.000
In the first term, this is the same as the previous slide where we are transferring xi to the image of xi prime,

07:13.000 --> 07:17.000
